{"id":108089073779090,"type":"album","name":"From the Choirgirl Hotel","artist":"Tori Amos","year":1998,"weight":18,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/10220-from-the-choirgirl-hotel-1.jpg","aoty":72,"aoty_user":87,"sputnik":4.17,"yt":"ohpp6-hgcuU","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/tori-amos/from-the-choirgirl-hotel","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/10220-tori-amos-from-the-choirgirl-hotel.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/20823/Tori-Amos-From-the-Choirgirl-Hotel/"},"desc":"Shortly before she began work on From the Choirgirl Hotel, Tori Amos suffered a miscarriage. While she was recording the album, she married her long-term boyfriend. As expected, both events cryptically wind their way into the album, which arguably has Amos' most personal lyrics since Little Earthquakes. The surprise is, From the Choirgirl Hotel is considerably more accessible than its immediate predecessor, Boys for Pele. Tori has opened up her sound by working live with a full band, bringing an immediacy to her sound that has never been heard before. Added to that are samples and drum loops, ballads supported ."},"artist_ref":{"id":82613475615867,"name":"Tori Amos","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tori_Amos_12_01_2017_-35_%2825495988058%29.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2664,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":30277598324326,"type":"genre","name":"pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1523,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":126030611694007,"type":"genre","name":"Art Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":310,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":210775829953573,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Art Pop","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":44,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":199353246998089,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 199